ct disaster-management systems"},{"text":"Government emergency-management programs"},{"text":"Municipal authorities"},{"text":"Public infrastructure organizations"},{"text":"Emergency services"},{"text":"Research institutions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential work areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Disaster preparedness"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Emergency planning"},{"text":"Relief coordination"},{"text":"Rehabilitation"},{"text":"Recovery"},{"text":"Climate resilience"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Specific government roles and eligibility depend on the recruitment notification."}]},{"heading":"Humanitarian Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Students interested in humanitarian work can develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Emergency logistics"},{"text":"Shelter management"},{"text":"Food and water distribution"},{"text":"Community engagement"},{"text":"Protection principles"},{"text":"Needs assessment"},{"text":"Field reporting"},{"text":"Monitoring and evaluation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential progression:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Program Assistant","Program Officer","Emergency Program Officer","Humanitarian Program Manager","Response Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"International humanitarian organizations may also value field experience, specialized training, and strong communication skills."}]},{"heading":"Disaster Management + Climate Change","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A particularly strong future specialization is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Disaster Management + Climate Resilience"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate hazards"},{"text":"Extreme weather"},{"text":"Heatwaves"},{"text":"Flood risk"},{"text":"Drought"},{"text":"Sea-level rise"},{"text":"Coastal vulnerability"},{"text":"Climate adaptation"},{"text":"Resilience planning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Project:"},{"type":"h","text":"Climate Disaster Risk Assessment"},{"type":"flow","items":["Climate projections + hazard d